error[R0202]: `item` is checked for nil after it was already indexed
--> 7:17: nil check here
    6:15: `item` is indexed here — throws if it is nil
  = note: every path from the last assignment of `item` to this check reaches the use first, so if `item` can be nil the use throws and this check never runs
  = help: move the check above the first use, or drop it if `item` cannot be nil
